**Written to `requirements.md`:**

`## Acceptance Criteria`
- CSV export button on reports page exports **summary report only** (not detail, not all-reports).
- Export includes **full dataset across all pages**, not just current visible page.
- CSV columns = **columns currently visible in the table**.

`## Scope Definition`
- **In:** summary report, full dataset, visible columns.
- **Out:** detail/other report types, hidden/underlying fields, per-user column config.

